<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of an English county championship cricket match on Friday:</p>
<p>At Blackpool: Lancashire beat Warwickshire by three wickets. Warwickshire 139 and 310 (A.Giles 72, D.Brown 53; D.Shadford 5-80), Lancashire 362 and 91-7 (G.Welch 5-25).</p>
<p>Lancashire 24 points, Warwickshire 4.</p>
